# Exceptions to tools/release-scan: `path-glob  regex`. A hit is forgiven only if the file matches the
# glob and the line matches the regex.
# The IDMT-SMT-Guitar dataset names its guitars; these lines quote the dataset's own labels.
blocks/tuner/bench/quality/*  Ibanez Power Strat|ibanez-power-strat
bench/quality/*               Ibanez Power Strat|ibanez-power-strat
